# Core ML models, kept out of history: 139 MB of weights that git would carry
# forever, and both are reproducible. See ShotDex/Resources/Models/README.md for
# how to put them back. The app works without them — Sky masks and AI Fill are
# hidden or fall back when a model is missing.
